# Q47 What is affected if this table or system changes: for each system, and each table, every data object built from it, with the measures those compute and the agents bound to them.
PREFIX tg: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/technical-graph/>
SELECT ?changed ?affected ?measure ?agent WHERE {
  { ?database tg:standsFor ?changed . ?start tg:copies ?database . }
  UNION
  { ?changed a tg:Table . BIND(?changed AS ?start) }
  ?affected tg:readsFrom+ ?start .
  OPTIONAL { ?affected tg:implements ?measure }
  OPTIONAL { ?agent tg:binds ?affected }
}
